Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:31.79,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,No doubt about it. This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:46.55,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I found the holy sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.15,0:00:54.58,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Salamander!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:04.35,Main - Italics,LIESE/ID,0,0,0,,She dodged?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:13.84,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Didn't she say we couldn't \Nso much as lay a finger on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:19.10,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Yup. Looks like our odds aren't \Nas hopeless as she thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.73,0:01:23.55,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:07.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What a performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.61,0:03:10.29,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,How dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:13.09,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,How dare you break my horn?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:14.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Whoa there, not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.27,0:03:17.95,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Come any closer, and I'll smash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:21.99,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Get your foot off that, human scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:27.02,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I know demons' horns are their pride,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:31.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,to the point that the hornless\N are considered subdemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:38.06,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Boy, the governor found an \Nelaborate way to hide this baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:39.94,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Is that the holy sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:42.51,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,It's impeccably weighted and balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:44.32,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,It fits perfectly in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:48.74,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,You bastard! Surrender the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:53.09,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not handing this over \Njust because you said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:55.50,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I haven't even tested it out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:58.46,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You filth...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:02.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:05.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Why don't we call a temporary truce?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:07.39,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:09.74,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,What are you proposing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:12.85,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We have sick and injured over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:15.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I don't want to press this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:20.03,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Three days from now, \Nwe'll meet again for a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:23.07,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,A duel, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:24.40,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:28.75,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We'll return here to fight, and if you win,\Nwe'll give you the sword and your horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:30.89,Main - Top,THERON,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not up to—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:34.46,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,If we win, you'll tell us about the demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:38.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,including who else of your kind \Nhas infiltrated human society.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:43.09,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You'll give us all \Nthe demon intelligence you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:49.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll face you solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:56.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Surely you wouldn't refuse a fair duel \Nagainst a human you see as inferior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:04:59.82,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:06.41,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Return here in three days' time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.07,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm ba—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.06,0:05:50.69,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.17,Main - Top,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,Gazus, I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:06.85,Main - Top,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:09.33,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,So they really are lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:08.88,Main - Top,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,If anything happened to you, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.77,Main - Top,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Ya goober! Stop hugging me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:13.30,Main - Top,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Go on! Get offa me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:21.18,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt, Gazus and Miranda,\Nbut I have some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.11,0:06:28.86,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,The governor wasn't always this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:33.37,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,He truly cares for Karan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.97,0:06:36.27,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,He's just going about things the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.79,0:06:39.39,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I was born and raised here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:41.67,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I understand how he feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:46.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,When did you learn about the missing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:48.40,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,A month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:52.46,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I told him countless times to stop, \Nbut he wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:55.19,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,We had to be careful, \Nlest he try to silence us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:07:00.38,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,But I'm Karan's best blacksmith,\N if I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:04.12,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,In other words, the city needs you to prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:08.55,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Yeah, but the governor didn't \Njust refuse to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:12.18,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,He demanded my cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:18.49,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,He threatened to kill Goh and \NMiranda if I didn't do as he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:26.21,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,So I've been keeping my distance, \Nhoping they wouldn't get dragged into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:33.59,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,By the way, about the Holy Sword Rand...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:36.81,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Let Theron keep the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.52,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,He's the one who found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:40.35,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,It belongs to Karan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:42.48,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,It's a priceless national treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:45.23,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah, that may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:49.97,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Firstly, Gazus, we just saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:51.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:53.87,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,A-And I'm grateful, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.87,0:07:59.75,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,In addition, Theron and my friends here\Nprotected Goh when your home was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:02.71,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Then, during the slaughter at the embassy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:06.93,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I drove off the demon and protected\N Miranda, who was also there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.38,0:08:12.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,In other words, we've saved\N three lives, yours included.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:21.09,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,On top of that, you've had trouble\Nsourcing mithril, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:22.91,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:25.90,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I-Is this mithril?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:30.28,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. We excavated a ton \Nfrom some Xarles ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:36.03,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,One of our goals in coming to Karan was \Nto find a blacksmith who could use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.07,0:08:43.29,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You probably are the best \Nblacksmith on the continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:47.50,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You may eventually forge a blade \Ngreater than the holy sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.80,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,G-Greater than the holy sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:54.91,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We'll provide the mithril you need to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:57.04,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Use as much as you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:59.90,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,A-As much mithril as I'd like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:01.31,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Picture it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.57,0:09:07.59,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Imagine yourself using all the high-quality \Nmithril you want to forge a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:13.21,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now then, considering our fantastic offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:17.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,surely there won't be a problem \Nwith one holy sword going missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:19.29,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:23.27,Default,MIRANDA,0,0,0,,The holy sword was never \Nin Karan. Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:28.10,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I-If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.97,0:09:32.88,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I'm glad Gazus is the kind of guy who \Nlets his partner call the shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:36.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Next up, there's something\N I'd like you to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:40.58,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,You want me to make this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:42.66,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. Think you can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:45.87,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Now that mithril's not an issue, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.87,0:09:47.81,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,But it'll take me three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.81,0:09:49.02,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Do it in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:50.13,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Two days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.13,0:09:51.59,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:53.82,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous but not impossible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:57.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I have a duel three days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:10:00.42,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I need it before then. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:05.31,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Damn it! The man who saved my life \Njust had to be {\i1}this{\i0} pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:06.83,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:09.70,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,I gotta get my ass to the forge and hole up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:13.97,Default,GAZUS,0,0,0,,Miranda, look after Goh for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:22.34,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,We're all set there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.82,0:10:23.97,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,That just leaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:37.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Are you two okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:40.62,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yeah. We weren't seriously injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:47.39,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I still think that female \Ndemon was holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:50.85,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I couldn't land a single attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:53.11,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I had no idea demons were so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:57.80,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,The elders of my hometown \Ndescribed them as fearsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:59.97,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,It seems they did not exaggerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.97,0:11:02.06,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Their power is on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.67,0:11:05.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You don't have to force yourselves to fight—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.05,0:11:06.42,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,But it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:09.02,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,We'll win next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:10.33,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:13.48,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Yes. They think we are beneath them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:15.40,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,We can exploit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:19.90,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I was planning to tag in\N Theron next time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.85,Main - Italics,KYLE/ID,0,0,0,,I didn't think they'd be so motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:27.66,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,So there's nothing for me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:31.42,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,No. If it comes to it, \Ncut the demons down from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.41,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,The dirty work's on me, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:36.01,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You said this would be a fair duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.01,0:11:37.92,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,All part of my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:40.61,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You're one nasty dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:44.43,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Was putting off the fight even necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:49.31,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Yeah. I can't have them getting \Ncornered and desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:52.09,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Oh, right. The magic circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.59,0:11:54.26,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:57.54,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You're just itching to use the holy sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:11:59.80,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:04.99,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Besides, the male demon didn't seem \Ntoo concerned with the holy sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:07.58,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,so we needed to get our hands on {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:10.66,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You were after his horn from the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:14.41,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Either way, those demons were pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:17.58,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,We won't necessarily win in a fair fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.09,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:21.09,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,That's why I asked for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.11,0:12:37.19,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It's definitely on the brink of imploding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:39.77,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We need to do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:42.62,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Releasing magic power is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:46.90,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Once you learn how, even you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:50.39,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The magic power in this catalyst...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:52.93,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Can't I transfer it to the\NDivine Dragon's Heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:13:02.02,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I see. This thing could easily store enough \Nmagic power to destroy a city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.77,0:13:05.38,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,It'll take days to complete the transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:09.89,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Out of curiosity,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:16.14,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,was it even possible to use earth-shifting\Nmagic to force more mithril to the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:21.62,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,No. All the veins in this \Narea have been depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.28,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:27.29,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Even if they'd been able to gather more,\Nit would have altered the landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:29.90,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,This city would have still been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.57,0:13:34.49,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,So everything the governor did was for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:52.34,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,The duel is tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.34,0:14:55.11,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,How can he be so relaxed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:57.97,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,I prefer it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:00.71,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We can't afford to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:06.13,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,To prevent the Great Invasion, \Nwhat we need most is intel on demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:10.05,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,In particular, about the next demon king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.11,0:15:31.24,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,They're not here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:35.18,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,It was a mistake not to specify a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:38.01,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You've always been like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:40.00,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,You forget the important details.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:45.89,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,I doubt they'll show up soon, \Nso why don't we have some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:52.02,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,More importantly, did you come up with a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.02,0:15:53.76,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:57.11,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I'm not so arrogant as to think\Nour victory is certain,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:15:59.70,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,but we do have a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:13.28,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,So you didn't run away, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.26,0:16:16.53,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:20.54,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Kyle, you've got crumbs on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:21.26,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:22.59,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,What a slob.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:23.89,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.89,0:16:25.05,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Get this cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:26.94,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Theron, don't just sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:28.98,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,How did you make such a mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:30.82,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:37.75,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm amazed you'd have tea\N before a duel with demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:39.25,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} didn't have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:41.81,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'm not the one fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:44.88,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,You lot requested this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.88,0:16:47.00,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Do you mean to mock us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.95,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,Let them be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:52.82,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,They're trying to lower our \Nguard and stoke our rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:54.98,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Sorry about the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:17:00.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now, let's settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:05.17,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:07.79,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,First, why don't we go elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.33,0:17:13.47,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,You and I will fight one-on-one, but this \Nchamber's too cramped for two fights at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:17.55,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:20.37,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,You'll just be choosing where you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:22.06,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:24.01,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Won't this give them an advantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:27.15,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I don't care if they have\N tricks up their sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:30.07,Default,GARNIAS,0,0,0,,I shall utterly destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:33.06,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:36.07,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:37.13,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:42.92,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You're staying here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:46.58,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,I'm to inform him immediately \Nif anything happens here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:49.74,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Normally I should stay with my sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:53.02,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,but as long as I still supply it\Nwith magic power, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:56.84,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Now then, are you prepared?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.84,0:17:59.09,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,I'm just here as a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:03.60,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,If you beat those two, \NI'll give you the holy sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:07.01,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:11.11,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't want to do this, \Nbut it's for the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.61,0:18:18.50,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I learned from our previous fight \Nthat you're reasonably strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:28.37,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,This time, I will fight at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:49.82,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,If you don't want to die, \Nyou should surrender soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:53.38,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:56.19,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,It's a bit unexpected,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:19:01.03,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,but if they can survive the first attack, \Nit should be a decent fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.97,0:19:12.42,Main - Italics,LIESE/ID,0,0,0,,She's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.44,Main - Italics,LIESE/ID,0,0,0,,Way faster than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:18.67,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Salamander!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:22.01,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.25,0:19:25.47,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Hot stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:31.91,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,You're in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:36.27,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Gnome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:40.51,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Two at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:46.22,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Got—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:51.58,Main - Italics,LIESE/ID,0,0,0,,She just grazed me, \Nbut I can barely stay conscious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:19:56.95,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,No you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:12.10,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,As I thought, \Nthe difference in power is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:14.65,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:21.15,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,You're not wrong, but if I'm not careful,\Nthey'll kill me later for interfering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.41,0:20:24.66,Default,THERON,0,0,0,,Besides, the situation isn't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.67,0:20:27.11,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,She's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:29.65,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:32.95,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say she's unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.55,0:20:37.94,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,You're quite tough, but it's time to end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:38.96,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Gnome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:41.17,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,Futile!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:42.05,Default,URZA,0,0,0,,Liese!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.05,0:20:42.95,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:46.55,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,I'll tear through you and your spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.81,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:53.92,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,One more where that came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:02.83,Main - Italics,YULIGA/ID,0,0,0,,The gnome wasn't a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.86,Main - Italics,YULIGA/ID,0,0,0,,It was there to block my view.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:08.30,Default,YULIGA,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.43,Default,SILDONIA,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.51,0:21:42.57,Default,LIESE,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.05,0:21:53.33,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,This place will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.99,0:21:57.69,Default,KYLE,0,0,0,,Now, let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs12\shad0\blur1\bord1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,142.615)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\fs18\shad0\blur1\3c&HB6A872&\pos(320,208.461)}Secret Red-Hot Strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:39.39,Default,NA,0,0,0,,Next time: "Secret Red-Hot Strategy."
